Hello Brightwell,

Please find our seasonal drinkware offer. Photo of the Haunted House cup attached, other photos to follow. All prices USD, FOB Shenzhen. Made in China.

Item No.   | Product                                                          | Price/pc | MOQ     | Production | Sea freight
3SSHD023   | Heartfelt Cheer Tumbler Canyon Cup, "Peace Love Joy", 40 oz      | 6.35     | 500 pcs | 50 days    | 25 days
3SSHDM9998 | Haunted House Wickedly Sweet Trenta Cup, 30 oz, with straw       | 6.90     | 600 pcs | 50 days    | 35 days
COG9F3MCF  | Holly Homestead coffee cup, holly berries and bow handle, 8 oz   | 3.35     | 300 pcs | 40 days    | 30 days

Specs
- 3SSHD023: 4 x 5.9 x 10.7 in. Double wall stainless steel, plastic lid and straw. Hand wash only, do not microwave. Colour box. Collection Heartfelt Cheer, season Christmas. Artist EveArt.
- 3SSHDM9998: 5 x 3.5 x 9.5 in, 1.25 lb. Stainless steel body, PP lid, ABS straw. Hand wash only. Colour box with window and gift box. Collection Haunted House, Halloween. Artist EveArt.
- COG9F3MCF: 3.15 x 4.92 x 3.54 in, 0.62 lb. Ceramic (stoneware). Packaged with UPC sticker only. Collection Holly Homestead, Christmas. No named artist.

Our best seller this year is the Haunted House cup. At USD 6.09 per piece it is a very attractive price for a Halloween gift cup, and we expect it to sell out early.

Samples: USD 18 each. Compliance: FDA food-contact report available.

